    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46918" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭperventus</span></b> ,
		ūs, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				coming up</i> or <i>upon</i>, <i>an
				arrival</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i><span class="en">Plin. 7, 15, 13, § 64</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Tac. H.
				2, 54</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic., in milit. lang., <i>an
			attack</i>, <i><span class="en">Veg. Mil. 3, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3,
				22</span></i>.</div>
